  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "E. Clayton Gengras was an American businessman who built a fortune in car dealerships before expanding into insurance and transportation. A dentist’s son from West Hartford, he left school to sell cars and developed a large regional dealership network. The sale of his insurance group made him a major Textron shareholder.",
    "html": "<p>E. Clayton Gengras was an American businessman who built a fortune in car dealerships before expanding into insurance and transportation. A dentist’s son from West Hartford, he left school to sell cars and developed a large regional dealership network. The sale of his insurance group made him a major Textron shareholder.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 51,
    "confidence": {
